\f3 \cf0 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f4\fs26 Somehow, Sarah identified the correct car when she saw it slowly wobbling towards them and they both hopped on with no troubles. Expecting to see the three wise-rapists, they were very surprised to be met by a group of well-dressed Elvi, all in stances of different martial arts styles, ready to fight.\
\'93Who are you? What do you want?\'94 Tae Kwan Do Elvis had a suspicious mind.\
\'93Hey boys, what\'92s up?\'94 Cracker was cheerful and always got on well with the Elvi \'93I am Anthony Hardy. I guess you guys are all called Elvis?\'94 He smiled widely.\
\'93The Great Teacher!\'94 Wing Chung Elvis knelt and bowed low, his forehead touching the floor. \
\'93No need for that, Elvis. This is Sarah.\'94\
\'93Oh, the Blessed Mother!\'94 Karate Elvis dropped to his knees. \'93We are truly honoured.\'94\
 \'93Get up.\'94 Sarah was presently obsessed with tracking Kleo and his band of assailants and found Elvi adoration repellant. \'93Where are the sages, Elvis?\'94\
\'93They have been summoned by the High Elvis on a mission of great importance and we have been given the task of defending their keep, Blessed Mother.\'94 Karate was now standing erect and staring ahead.\
\'93Don\'92t call me that. I still don\'92t know if I going to full term yet.\'94 Sarah came from the \'91my body, my choice\'92 school of thought and knew she had not said anything controversial. \
\'93No, No. Please Blessed Mother.\'94 Karate again dropped to his knees. \'93You must deliver to us the one-after-the-one. I fear my brothers and sisters would become lost and would risk being infected by the religion.\'94 Karate Elvis\'92 hands were shaking and lips quivering, eyes welling up. He came from the \'91my Saviour, my business\'92 school of thought. \'93We cannot be denied him.\'94\
\'93That is probably not a discussion you want to have with the Blessed Mother, Elvis.\'94 Cracker didn\'92t know much about women, but he knew men had no lines in that play. \
\'93Forgive me, great teacher.\'94 Unconvinced, tears cascaded down his face. \
\'93Tell me, Elvi, where have the sages gone?\'94 Sarah was not moved by the embarrassing display.\
\'93They are in the quarter, five of our number been possessed by the Jesus.\'94 Karate managed to get out through the tears.\
\'93The protection of the Dawkins be upon them.\'94 Tae Kwan Do and Wing Chung parroted.\
\'93Then we shall go to the quarter and find the sages.\'94 Sarah announced as if the travelator had a steering wheel and had expected the helmsmen to change course.\
\'93It will take about 6 hours to get back around there.\'94 Karate grabbed his guitar and started playing, the two others joining in for an impromptu concert.\
