\f3 \cf0 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f4\fs26 \'93It\'92s safe to say all of the Elvi will have a similar reaction and if you expect support from the Elvine, you will be very disappointed. They are all sterile and will not understand the destruction of such a precious gift.\'94 The ways of the Elvi were complex, but also childlike. Cracker had been dealing with them for many years and had only recently been able to navigate the nuanced social structure of the clone nation.\
\'93Their view seems unequivocal, but it is none of their business. I will be careful not to to speak of this again, certainly not while we are in the quarter.\'94\
\'93Only five hours and fifty-nine minutes to go.\'94 Cracker said as the concert continued.
